{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The code and spec now describe commit paths as bounded, uncached governed reads. I also confirmed the documented limits: caller-owned input bytes and copies sit outside the cache budget; RSS and whole-command speedup remain unverified. I’m checking cache lifetimes and error propagation against those limits.\n"}}
